OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey actor hopes his
OL,4,Aband will be 'the next Stereophonics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has recently released a new single
OL,7,Fand he and his fellow band members are
OL,8,Fon a "mission to create a new modern
OL,9,Fsound for Wales".
